# Two atoms, one of which takes the result of another one as an argument.
#
#   ⟦ int ↦ ⟦ v ↦ ∅, inc ↦ ⟦ ρ ↦ ∅, λ ⤍ L_inc ⟧, times ↦ ⟦ ρ ↦ ∅, x ↦ ∅, λ ⤍ L_times ⟧, φ ↦ ξ.v ⟧, six ↦ Φ.int(v ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-06 ⟧), foo ↦ Φ.six.times(x ↦ Φ.six.inc) ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 int six foo
F c1 v inc times φ
F c2 ρ
λ c2 L_inc
P c1 inc c2
F c3 ρ x
λ c3 L_times
P c1 times c3
D c4 c1 v
P c1 φ c4
P c0 int c1
D c5 c0 int
F c6
Δ c6 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-06
A c7 c5 v c6
P c0 six c7
D c8 c0 six
D c9 c8 times
D c10 c0 six
D c11 c10 inc
A c12 c9 x c11
P c0 foo c12
